 "explicit_non_claims": [
  "structural certification only: this is not astrological-calculation certification",
  "declares no production analytical input, and is served by no API",
  "makes no analytical claim: nothing here scores, weights, fits or computes confidence",
  "every record used is synthetic; no real personal data is certified or permitted",
  "the event-class seed is certified equal to the registry, not the registry's classes correct; the registry stays DRAFT and its origin column is carried, not ratified",
  "admissibility as validation input is a gate on system hypotheses and rejections only; H2 and H4 may add requirements",
  "SUPPORT_PATHS_V1 gates H and I still certify the H0 foundations; this artifact does not retire them",
  "the ledger's purpose check and leakage check cover reads through the ledger only: EventStore, EntityStore, the ledger's own database connection and direct SQLite access read protected events without a purpose and without a log entry, and no such read can be detected here",
  "the store draws the holdout seed and forbids refreezing any frozen event, but cannot stop a caller recording near-duplicate events to build a new eligible set",
  "no TEST record, performance measurement or validation-run result is certified: they need H5 and rule application",
  "rule-version references are synthetic structural references: not proof of registration or validation in the future rule registry, and they authorize no interpretation",
  "no rule is applied and no chart is interpreted: evidence items are synthetic records exercising the model",
  "confidence components and historical performance are carried as supplied or absent, never computed; measured reliability, cross-method and timing convergence are absent",
  "relationships are classified only from each item's own recorded inputs, derivation links and completeness statements; no convergence count or bound is computed, and CORRELATED is never assigned",
  "the store cannot verify that a producer's completeness statements are true; it only refuses to call a pair INDEPENDENT without them"
 ],
